# Gary.dlg

# --- Default fallback (lowest priority — fires only when nothing else matches)

default
    $n Rent's due on Sundays. Don't forget or you'll hear from me
	
* | !global:apartment_rented
	$n You need a room?
	$b
	$h It's $500 for the damage deposit and $100 a week.
	$q
	--> "Deal" | cash -500; set global:apartment_rented
		$n Welcome home. Rent's every Sunday — don't be late.
	--> "Nah, I'm good"
		$n Come back when you've got the money.
	$r